# RULE-CONFIRM-KEYS: Escape at a `/permissions` rule confirmation asked
# while a turn runs. fx v0.0.16 runs the command at once
# (input_submit_runtime.zig:721-724@481104fd) and asks it in its approval
# prompt; Escape there is `cancelApprovalOperation`
# (app_input_runtime.zig:2689, :2712-2716): the turn is stopped and the
# confirmation goes, saying nothing about the rule
# (input_approval_runtime.zig:401-436). The stream is held mid-answer while
# the confirmation is up, and let go after the Escape.
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
gateway p5-rule-confirm-keys-turn.json
work permissions-early-ws
wait 2
type say something
key Enter
held
type /permissions remember deny read_file {"path":"a.txt"}
key Enter
until shown 1. Confirm
snap prompt
key Escape
wait 1
snap esc
release
wait 1.5
snap end
